Package: GO.ddb
Title: Tidy Interface to GO Semantic SQL via DuckDB
Version: 0.99.4
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Vincent", "Carey", email = "stvjc@channing.harvard.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4046-0063")), person("Claude", "Sonnet46", role="eng"))
Description: Provides a tidyverse-oriented user interface to Gene Ontology
    data via the Semantic SQL representation, accessed through DuckDB.
    Replaces the GO.db + AnnotationDbi::select nexus with lazy tibble-based
    operations for term lookup, ancestor/descendant traversal, and
    gene-GO annotation queries.  The Semantic SQL resource is managed by
    the ontoProc2 package via BiocFileCache.
